.TH tuini n 0.1 tclutils
.SH tclutils::tuini
.PP
INI reader/writer. Parses into a dict section \-> (dict key \-> value); keys before any \fB[section]\fR live in the global section "". Order is preserved. Comments (\fB;\fR or \fB#\fR) are dropped.
.CS
tuini::parse iniText            ;# -> data dict
tuini::toIni data               ;# -> INI text
tuini::sections data
tuini::keys data ?section?
tuini::get  data section key ?default?
tuini::has  data section key
tuini::setValue data section key value   ;# -> new data dict
.CE
.PP
Error code: \fB{TCLUTILS TUINI SYNTAX}\fR.
